> resultant a*x + b, c*x + d
resultant a*x + b, c*x + d
  in x: a*d - b*c
> resultant x^2 + a*x + b, x^2 + c*x + d
resultant x^2 + a*x + b, x^2 + c*x + d
  in x: a^2*d - a*b*c - a*c*d + b^2 + b*c^2 - 2b*d + d^2
> resultant a*x^2 + b*x + c, d*x + f
resultant a*x^2 + b*x + c, d*x + f
  in x: a*f^2 - b*d*f + c*d^2
> resultant x^2 - a, x^2 - b
resultant x^2 - a, x^2 - b
  in x: a^2 - 2a*b + b^2
    = (a - b)^2
> resultant x^2 + p*x + q, x + r
resultant x^2 + p*x + q, x + r
  in x: q - p*r + r^2
    = r^2 - (p*r - q)
> resultant u*x^2 + v, w*x + z
resultant u*x^2 + v, w*x + z
  in x: u*z^2 + v*w^2
